OL,3,GNEWSAStation goes 24/7 as 20
OL,4,Afirefighters recruited
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrantham Fire Station will become a
OL,7,F24-hour station as 20 full-time
OL,8,Ffirefighters are recruited across
OL,9,FLincolnshire.
OL,11,FPlans were approved after Lincolnshire
OL,12,FFire and Rescue reviewed its emergency
OL,13,Fresponse model in a bid to future-proof
OL,14,Fthe service.
OL,16,FFire chiefs said the new model would
OL,17,Fprovide a more sustainable service and
OL,18,Freduce reliance on on-call crews.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
