OL,3,GNEWSAStation goes 24/7 as 20
OL,4,Afirefighters recruited
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant chief fire officer Ryan
OL,7,FStacey said: "The intention is to
OL,8,Fprovide effective night time cover
OL,9,Fwhile strengthening the overall
OL,10,Fresilience of the county-wide response
OL,11,Fmodel."
